const xqForm = (kind, pre = {}) => { const [t, sub, fs] = XQ[kind]; return `<div class="mhead"><h3>${t}</h3><button class="ib" data-close>${ic('x')}</button></div><p class="note" style="margin-bottom:12px">${sub}</p><form class="form" id="xqForm" data-kind="${kind}">${Object.entries(pre).map(([k, v]) => `<input type="hidden" name="${k}" value="${esc(v)}">`).join('')}${fs.filter(f => !(f[0] in pre)).map(([n, l, ty]) => ty === 'ta' ? `<label class="f">${l}<textarea class="in" name="${n}" required></textarea></label>` : ty === 'yn' ? `<fieldset class="f"><legend>${l}</legend><div class="seg radios"><label><input type="radio" name="${n}" value="Yes" required> Yes</label><label><input type="radio" name="${n}" value="Maybe"> Maybe</label><label><input type="radio" name="${n}" value="No"> No</label></div></fieldset>` : ty === 'proof' ? `<fieldset class="f"><legend>${l}</legend><div class="seg radios"><label><input type="radio" name="${n}" value="Official email domain" required> My email is on our official domain</label><label><input type="radio" name="${n}" value="Phone call to public number"> Call our public number</label><label><input type="radio" name="${n}" value="Letterhead upload"> I’ll send a letter on our letterhead</label></div></fieldset>` : `<label class="f">${l}<input class="in" name="${n}" ${n === 'email' ? 'type="email"' : ''} required></label>`).join('')}<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" required> I’m happy for SMR Digital to use these details to deal with this request.</label><button class="btn p">Send</button></form>`; };
const XQRES = { 'funded-partnership': ['Application received', 'Places are limited, we’ll be in touch.'], 'oms-demo': ['Demo request received', 'We’ll be in touch to find a time that suits you.'], 'verify-claim': ['Claim received', 'We’ll check it and let you know. Once verified, your HD logo pack is free.'], 'enquiry': ['Sent', 'Your message is in their inbox.'] };
document.addEventListener('submit', e => { const f = e.target; if (f.id !== 'xqForm') return; e.preventDefault(); e.stopImmediatePropagation(); const kind = f.dataset.kind, data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f)); if (kind === 'enquiry') { const ib = store.get('hubinbox', []); ib.unshift({ id: 'e' + Date.now(), t: 'enquiry', title: 'Enquiry from ' + (data.name || 'someone'), body: data.msg, from: data.contact, orgId: data.orgId, at: Date.now(), st: 'new' }); store.set('hubinbox', ib); } logAct(XQ[kind][0]); const r = XQRES[kind]; submit(kind, data, `${XQ[kind][0]}\n` + Object.entries(data).map(([k, v]) => `${k}: ${v}`).join('\n'), r ? { title: r[0], text: r[1] } : null); }, true);
document.addEventListener('click', e => { const b = e.target.closest('[data-xq]'); if (!b) return; e.preventDefault(); let pre = {}; try { pre = JSON.parse(b.dataset.pre || '{}'); } catch (er) { } if (b.dataset.xq === 'verify-claim' && !signedIn()) return needAcct('Claiming a listing needs a free account, so we can link it to you.'); modal(xqForm(b.dataset.xq, pre)); });
document.addEventListener('click', e => { const b = e.target.closest('[data-acct]'); if (!b) return; e.preventDefault(); needAcct(b.dataset.acct); });
const logAct = t => { const a = store.get('activity', []); a.unshift({ t, at: Date.now() }); store.set('activity', a.slice(0, 60)); };

